# UI and Research Rules

- Support Indonesian and English architecture from the beginning.
- Meet WCAG 2.2 AA for core journeys.
- Public browsing should be mobile responsive; Dress Weaver may be desktop-first but must remain usable on tablets.
- Show provenance, review status, access status, and uncertainty near cultural information.
- Use persistent IDs and visible version labels on research-critical objects.
- Research exports include a codebook and reproducibility manifest.
- Usage analytics are not automatically research data. Study collection requires approved consent and protocol.
- Never present exploratory photo color values as calibrated scientific measurements.
